{
    "_comment_r2v2_arm_waist_tuning": "2026-05-23: tuned from local walk/run/jump diagnostics. Torso orientation is kept on the BVH Spine2 target; hand end-body tasks are disabled because the R2V2 no-hand model has no wrist DoF and otherwise pulls the torso away from the BVH body angle.",
