        "comment": "Low-priority neutral-posture regularization. Based on mink PostureTask docs: posture tasks bias redundant/conflicting IK solutions toward a target posture while FrameTasks keep tracking motion. Arm-pitch target_offsets are a small qpos-space bias to lower the forearms without changing torso FrameTask weights.",
